@startuml
title Preliminary article structuring process
skinparam handwritten true
start
:Receive article title and English text (X);
:Clean and number paragraphs;
:Classify the subject;
if (Person or country?) then (yes)
  :Select the corresponding infobox;
endif
:Identify entities and extract supported facts;
:Group paragraphs into sections;
:Assemble and validate the draft;
if (Valid output?) then (yes)
  :Return structured article (y) for editor review;
else (no)
  :Show validation error;
endif
stop
@enduml
